Apollo 13
The two Markdown files under datasets/apollo13/raw/ contain NASA-supplied
US Government mission transcript and Review Board main-report text.
datasets/apollo13/metadata.jsonl records the exact NASA download URLs, hashes,
attribution, transcript bounds and normalization, including Heiko Kueffen's
formatter credit for the supplied transcript. No NASA endorsement is implied;
no NASA logos, images, audio or video are bundled. These source records are
not covered by the project's MIT grant.

